@startuml GUI_Layer
scale 2
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam nodesep 26
skinparam ranksep 30
caption v2.2.1 · 归档格式 v3

title GUI 层 — Qt 6 静态构建

class MainWindow <<QMainWindow>> {
    ** 压缩页控件 **
    - m_compressModeCombo : QComboBox* / m_fileListWidget : QListWidget*
    - m_outputDirEdit / m_outputFileNameEdit / m_passwordEdit : QLineEdit*
    - m_startCompressBtn : QPushButton* / m_compressProgressBar : QProgressBar*
    - m_compressCurrentFileLabel / m_compressProgressLabel : QLabel*
    - m_compressLogEdit : QTextEdit*
    --
    ** 解压页控件 **
    - m_decompressFilePathEdit / m_decompressOutputDirEdit : QLineEdit*
    - m_decompressSubfolderEdit / m_decompressPasswordEdit : QLineEdit*
    - m_startDecompressBtn : QPushButton* / m_decompressProgressBar : QProgressBar*
    - m_decompressCurrentFileLabel / m_decompressProgressLabel : QLabel*
    - m_decompressLogEdit : QTextEdit*
    --
    ** 框架与状态 **
    - m_tabWidget : QTabWidget* / m_backgroundPixmap : QPixmap
    - m_workerThread : QThread* / m_worker : CompressionWorker*
    - m_isProcessing : bool
    --
    ** 槽函数 **
    - 列表：onAddFilesClicked / onAddFolderClicked / onRemoveFileClicked
    - onClearFilesClicked
    - 目录：onBrowseOutputDirClicked / onBrowseDecompressFileClicked
    - onBrowseDecompressOutputClicked
    - 启动：onStartCompressionClicked / onStartDecompressionClicked
    - 回调：onCompressionDetailedProgress / onCompressionFinished
    - onDecompressionDetailedProgress / onDecompressionFinished
    --
    ** 重写与辅助 **
    # dragEnterEvent / dropEvent / resizeEvent
    - setupUI / createCompressionTab / createDecompressionTab
    - addDroppedPaths / updateBackground
    - updateOutputDirectory / updateOutputFileName
    - pathExists / makeValidPath / elideText
    - applyPlaceholderPalette / setPlaceholderHint
    - localizeWorkerDialogMessage
}

class CompressionWorker <<QObject>> {
    - m_filesToCompress : QStringList / m_outputDir : QString
    - m_outputFileName : QString / m_password : QString
    - m_mode : Y_flib::CompressionMode
    - m_decompressInputFile / m_decompressOutputDir : QString
    - m_decompressPassword : QString
    - m_stopRequested : atomic~bool~ / m_lastEmittedProgress : double
    - m_lastProgressTime : steady_clock::time_point
    - {static} PROGRESS_INTERVAL_MS = 200 / PROGRESS_DELTA = 2.0
    --
    + setCompressionParams(..) / setDecompressionParams(..)
    + requestStop() / resetStopFlag() / isStopRequested() : bool
    + doCompression() / doDecompression()
    .. signals ..
    + detailedProgress(file, filePct, overallPct, status)
    + finished(success, message)
    --
    - validateCompressionParams() / validateDecompressionParams() : bool
    - shouldEmitProgress(currentProgress) : bool
}

class PlaceholderLineEdit <<QLineEdit>> {
    - m_ghostText : QString / m_ghostTextColor : QColor
    + setGhostText(text) / setGhostTextColor(color)
    # paintEvent(event)
}

class IconHandler {
    + {static} AssociateIconToSyFile(syPath, iconPath) : bool
    - {static} RegisterSyFileIcon(iconPath) : bool
    - {static} ExtractIconFromExe(iconPath) : bool
    - {static} Utf8ToWide(utf8) : wstring
    - {static} WideToUtf8(wide) : string
}

MainWindow *--> CompressionWorker : moveToThread
MainWindow ..> PlaceholderLineEdit : 输入框提示文字
CompressionWorker ..> IconHandler : 关联 .sy 文件图标

' ── 版面控制：以下连线不渲染，只用于摆放 ──
' 主窗口在左，工作对象在右，两者下方的辅助类各自对齐
MainWindow -right[hidden]-> CompressionWorker
MainWindow -down[hidden]-> PlaceholderLineEdit
CompressionWorker -down[hidden]-> IconHandler

note right of CompressionWorker
  界面运行在 GUI 主线程，压缩与解压任务在独立工作线程执行。
  进度由工作线程经排队信号回传，信号参数全部使用 Qt 内建元类型。
end note

note bottom of PlaceholderLineEdit
  **任务阶段与进度刻度**
  压缩：校验与建档 0 到 20，主循环 20 到 95，收尾 95 到 100
  解压：读头与建模块 0 到 15，主循环 15 到 95，收尾 95 到 100
end note

note bottom of IconHandler
  压缩：校验参数，写归档头，再调用 compressionLoop。
  解压：读归档头校验魔数，经 idToMode 探测模式，
  归档含加密且未填口令时直接返回失败，否则调用 decompressionLoop。
  进度信号按 200ms 间隔或 2% 增幅节流，进度到达 100% 时必定发出。
  取消由原子标志置位，任务内各检查点在进度回调中抛出异常结束循环。
end note

@enduml
